@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001

### Generate a single unsent mail-storage notification draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mail-storage-notification/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "samAccountName": "jsmith",
  "category": "Archive Mail",
  "htmlBody": "<p>Hello, your archive mailbox is nearly full.</p>",
  "includeManagerInCc": true
}
